            "show_country_flag": true,
            "date_text": "June 2026",
            "review_head": "Noticeable Energy Boost Without Jitters",
            "review_text": "I’ve been using this supplement for about six weeks now, and the difference in my daily energy levels is unbelievable. I no longer crash in the afternoon like I used to, and I feel a lot more focused during work. What I love most is that it gives me a clean boost without that shaky, overstimulated feeling I get from other products. The taste is actually pleasant, and it mixes well with water. Overall, this has become part of my daily routine, and I can’t imagine starting my day without it.",
