            "date_text": "March 2026",
            "review_head": "Great boost of energy without any crash. Love it!",
            "review_text": "This supplement gives me steady energy throughout the day without feeling jittery. I’ve already noticed better focus and less afternoon fatigue. Definitely staying in my routine. – Emma C.",
