            "date_text": "Feb 2026",
            "review_head": "Visible Results in 30 Days",
            "review_text": "I was skeptical at first because I’ve tried so many supplements that promised results but did nothing. However, after about 30 days of consistent use, I can confidently say this product works. My skin looks clearer, my focus in the morning has improved, and I just feel more balanced overall. Even my friends commented that I look more energized. I’ll definitely be buying this again, and I love that the bottle lasts longer than expected.",
